 # The specs: each project's from its home (its runner, its .cache, its lock), so one project's never see another's.
+# Each project's spec stage holds a machine-wide gate slot while it runs (c0157, z-nile/tests/slot.luau): this shell
+# takes one before the stage and gives it back after it, or on exit; concurrent gates on this machine queue for the
+# CPUs instead of oversubscribing them, and a lone gate never waits.
+slot="$PWD/z-nile/tests/slot.luau"
